 "protocol": {
  "summary": "15 min 500 N axial preconditioning; L3 caudal end fixed to laser-scanner base, L2 cranial end on the spine-tester gimbal (unconstrained); pure moments 2.5, 5, 7.5 Nm in flexion/extension, lateral bending, axial rotation (and 500 N axial compression for scans); RoM evaluated from the 2nd loading cycle; for surface scans specimens were driven to the maximal deflection and held (4 s laser scan). No preload during bending.",
  "how_to_simulate": [
   "Fix the caudal half of L3; L2 free (no preload)",
   "Apply pure moments 2.5, 5, 7.5 Nm in flexion, extension, right lateral bending, left axial rotation (and 500 N axial compression for bulge/strain)",
   "Report L2-L3 rotation at peak moment; for bulge report radial outer-annulus displacement at mid disc height at the anterior, left lateral, left posterolateral, posterior points (translation of L2 removed); for strain report max/min outer-annulus surface strains (axial z-z, circumferential phi-phi)",
   "Defects cumulative: (1) remove vertebral arches incl. SSL/ISL/FL and facets, (2) remove PLL and ALL, (3) nucleotomy (right posterolateral oblique incision, 2.9 g)"
  ],
  "subject_model": null,
  "notes": "Stage order: INTACT -> w/oVA -> w/oALL (PLL+ALL removed) -> w/oNUC. Values absolute (deg, mm, %), not % intact. Bulge sign: + outward, - inward. Posterior/posterolateral landmarks not accessible in intact specimens."
 },
